    "allocation": "Already represented GLOBAL/ordinary-owned/candidate cells only. No whole-record map rebasing, bitmap promotion or in-file free-page reuse.",
    "body_protection": "Every catalog INDEX/ColumnOwned body and foreign ordinary-owned body, including unreachable membership, denied as selected mutable DATA; definitions/map storage also protected.",
